    "title": "buzzArab Arab & Muslim Dating",
    "description": "Whether you're looking for friends, dating or your soulmate - buzzArab is the place for you.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Hundreds of thousands of members from around the Arab World, Europe, the US, the UK, Canada and Australia. Hundreds of new members join each day.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Members from different religions and different backgrounds. Whether you're Christian or Muslim, or of any other religion, or not religious at all, you're sure to find someone compatible.\r\n\r\n\u2022 All our services are 100% free. You can register, send and receive messages, all for free. Seriously.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Maintain your privacy. Avoid having to give out your phone number. You can make free voice calls, send voice messages or send photos from within buzzArab.\r\n\r\n\u2022 We actively monitor the quality of the app. All profiles and photos are approved by our team to ensure quality.  We remove hundreds of profiles every day.\r\n\r\n\u2022 For our female members : Are you tired of receiving messages from incompatible people half the way across the world? With buzzArab you can control who can contact you - by country, by age and even by languages spoken.\r\n\r\n\u2022 For our male members : Stop paying expensive monthly subscriptions. \r\n\r\nWhile we are focussed on serving the Arab community, we enthusiastically welcome members of all religions, all national backgrounds and all races. We are LGBTQ-friendly.\r\n\r\nPlease note that buzzArab is not an \"anything goes\" service - we try to maintain a high quality standard, and we aggressively apply our rules. Please help to keep buzzArab a place with genuine, respectful people. Please do not :\r\n\r\n\u2022 Use improper, degrading or racist language.\r\n\u2022 Use photos that are not yours.\r\n\u2022 Enter incorrect information in your profile such as your age, marital status or location.\r\n\u2022 Use buzzArab for any reason other than to meet people.\r\n\u2022 Create more than one profile on buzzArab.\r\n\r\nThere are many dating, chat and marriage apps out there, but buzzArab is not just another app - we are 100% focussed on delivering a QUALITY service. \r\n\r\nWhy wait? Download buzzArab now and start searching for new friends or your soulmate. Registration only takes a few minutes.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Whether you&#39;re looking for friends, dating or your soulmate - buzzArab is the place for you.<br><br>\u2022 Hundreds of thousands of members from around the Arab World, Europe, the US, the UK, Canada and Australia. Hundreds of new members join each day.<br><br>\u2022 Members from different religions and different backgrounds. Whether you&#39;re Christian or Muslim, or of any other religion, or not religious at all, you&#39;re sure to find someone compatible.<br><br>\u2022 All our services are 100% free. You can register, send and receive messages, all for free. Seriously.<br><br>\u2022 Maintain your privacy. Avoid having to give out your phone number. You can make free voice calls, send voice messages or send photos from within buzzArab.<br><br>\u2022 We actively monitor the quality of the app. All profiles and photos are approved by our team to ensure quality.  We remove hundreds of profiles every day.<br><br>\u2022 For our female members : Are you tired of receiving messages from incompatible people half the way across the world? With buzzArab you can control who can contact you - by country, by age and even by languages spoken.<br><br>\u2022 For our male members : Stop paying expensive monthly subscriptions. <br><br>While we are focussed on serving the Arab community, we enthusiastically welcome members of all religions, all national backgrounds and all races. We are LGBTQ-friendly.<br><br>Please note that buzzArab is not an &quot;anything goes&quot; service - we try to maintain a high quality standard, and we aggressively apply our rules. Please help to keep buzzArab a place with genuine, respectful people. Please do not :<br><br>\u2022 Use improper, degrading or racist language.<br>\u2022 Use photos that are not yours.<br>\u2022 Enter incorrect information in your profile such as your age, marital status or location.<br>\u2022 Use buzzArab for any reason other than to meet people.<br>\u2022 Create more than one profile on buzzArab.<br><br>There are many dating, chat and marriage apps out there, but buzzArab is not just another app - we are 100% focussed on delivering a QUALITY service. <br><br>Why wait? Download buzzArab now and start searching for new friends or your soulmate. Registration only takes a few minutes.",
